WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:01,850
Have a good rest

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:05,100
When you return to Jinling, there will be a series of guests waiting for you.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,650
Didn’t you say you wanted to train?

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,710
Take advantage of this while to practice thoroughly

5
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:14,260
Your boy refuses to find a safe place to stay

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,830
Then learn more about letting go

7
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:20,720
Training is something to go back to

8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,720
Not only am I comfortable now

9
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:26,220
By the way, Uncle Chen

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,800
My customized L5 has arrived, has it arrived?

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,800
Bulletproof panels are made to your specifications

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,800
Why do you still want to change it?

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,250
I want to ask for a number plate

14
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,250
What license plate

15
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:38,720
Leopard number or joint number?

16
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:41,850
For this kind of thing, just give Secretary Xu a call.

17
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,850
None

18
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,850
I want a license plate of CN1949

19
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:46,850
Is this the right match?

20
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:48,850
good boy

21
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,450
Have an idea

22
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:54,510
Indeed, this is the only way to go

23
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:55,510
I'll get it for you when I get back
